  "description": "Triker Pro Long-Range Fat-Tire Electric Trike\n\nRide farther, climb easier, and enjoy more confidence with the Triker Plus, a long-range three-wheel electric trike built for everyday transportation, neighborhood rides, and weekend adventures.\n\nGo Farther Between Charges\n\nPowered by a 48V 13Ah battery, the Triker Plus delivers up to 65 miles of pedal-assist range. Enjoy longer rides with fewer charging stops, whether you are running errands, visiting the park, or exploring your neighborhood.\n\nBuilt for Everyday Hills\n\nWith support for slopes up to a 30% grade, the Triker Plus helps make hills, driveways, ramps, and rolling roads easier to manage. Ride with greater confidence across routes with everyday inclines.\n\n16\" x 4.0\" Fat Tires\n\nThe wide 16\" x 4.0\" fat tires provide a larger contact area for improved traction and stability. They create a more planted riding feel on pavement, grass, packed gravel, and other everyday surfaces.\n\nFive Levels of Pedal Assist\n\nChoose the level of support that matches your ride. Use lower assistance for light exercise and relaxed cruising, or select a higher level when climbing hills, riding longer distances, or needing extra support.\n\n20 MPH Top Speed\n\nWith a top speed of up to 20 MPH, the Triker Plus gives you more freedom to travel farther and complete short trips more efficiently.\n\nConfidence-Focused Three-Wheel Design\n\nThe three-wheel platform provides a steady riding experience at low speeds, during stops, and while carrying everyday essentials. It is designed to make daily transportation more comfortable and accessible.\n\nKey Features\n\n48V 13Ah battery\n\nUp to 65 miles of pedal-assist range\n\nUp to 20 MPH top speed\n\nSupport for slopes up to a 30% grade\n\n16\" x 4.0\" fat tires\n\nFive levels of pedal assist\n\nStable three-wheel design\n\nDesigned for errands, neighborhood rides, parks, and leisure",
